# Crab-like creature on an 18x6 canvas.
# This expands each original block glyph into a 2x2 bitmap so half-blocks and
# quadrant corners are represented with actual drawn cells.
# Render with:
# npm start -- --path examples/crab.draw --width 18 --height 6

